        <li>The hostname is &quot;node2&quot; and the IPv4 address is &quot;10.10.12.2&quot;</li>
    </ul>
    <p>It may make sense for you to copy the private half or your SSH keys into ~/.ssh on the network. If you
    are worried about security, you can make a new key pair solely for lab use. 
    <p>When you log in and find the first flag, enter it in the box below.
    <p>Good luck!

